[Info]
Name	The Iron Cross
Description	Four keepers around a crossroads, quarter turn symmetric, with gold spokes nobody can hold quietly. 4 players. A hero company holds 4 keeps in the wilds; storm them for their gold, or leave them be and fight whatever they send out.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

